        <section role="acknowledgments"> 
          Adrian, first: I love you. Every day I try to think of ways to thank you for encouraging me to keep going through the toughest of times, and for the invaluable feedback you provided even though this book has been… not quite your cup of tea. Thank you. You are the best thing to ever happen to me.

          I wish also to thank Rambling Chantrix, who proved to me that I have an audience that will listen to everything I have to say then ask for more. She is the author of many vibrant and surreal-yet-heartfelt (and sexy) stories, including her debut short story omnibus, <work medium="book">Sad Porn About the End of the World</work>; more can be read about her work on her professional website (<work medium="site">rambling.chantrix.org</work>).

